slayer-editor (0.4.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. (Closes: #1150574)
    Qt 6 code editor with a tabbed interface, an embedded QTermWidget
    terminal dockable on any edge, F5 to compile and run (C, C++, Python,
    Rust, Go, JavaScript, Java and shell), Language Server Protocol
    diagnostics and inline (ghost-text) completion, Debug Adapter Protocol
    debugging, a Kate-style split view, status bar and auto-reload,
    syntax highlighting for many markup and config formats, a live HTML
    preview with automatic reload, a code minimap, indentation guides,
    matching block-delimiter and tag highlighting, several color themes,
    an optional symbol display, auto-save, an Open Recent menu, a find bar
    with search history, an inline go-to-line bar, per-file cursor
    position memory, and drag-and-drop of files to open them in new tabs.

 -- Wyllian Bezerra da Silva <wyllianbs@gmail.com>  Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:06:56 -0300
